<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Luxottica.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Luxottica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Luxottica Group SpA to intermediate-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said keep the long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Luxottica gained 3/8 to 67-1/8.</p>
</text>
